{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/018-gao-yang/wangli-yundu","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/018-gao-yang/wangli-yundu/data.json","title":"詩經韻讀 · 羔羊 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 召南 · 羔羊 · 汇集《詩經韻讀》关于《羔羊》的 2 条注释，含 2 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"018-gao-yang","materialId":"wangli-yundu"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/018-gao-yang/wangli-yundu","poem":{"id":"018-gao-yang","title":"羔羊","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"shaonan","path":["風","召南","羔羊"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"羔羊之皮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"素丝五紽","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"退食自公","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"委蛇委蛇","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"羔羊之革","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"素丝五緎","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"委蛇委蛇","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"自公退食","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"羔羊之缝","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"素丝五总","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"委蛇委蛇","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"退食自公","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"wangli-yundu","title":"詩經韻讀","authors":["王力"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","era":"现代","publicationYear":1980,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":2,"glossCount":2},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":2,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"《羔羊》韵读总说","targetNotes":"现存页图可见全篇。","sourceLabel":"第 18-19 页","sourceNotes":"书页 18-19《羔羊》全篇韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"现存页图可见《羔羊》全篇。王力把首章“皮(biai)、紽(dai)、蛇(jiua)”系于歌部相叶，第二章“革(kak)、緎(hiuok)、食(djiak)”转入职部，第三章“缝(biong)、总(tzong)、公(kong)”又归东部。三章各自成韵而顺次转部，正与诗中层层换辞的复沓结构相应。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":2,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"羔羊之皮，素丝五紽。退食自公，委蛇委蛇。羔羊之革，素丝五緎。委蛇委蛇，自公退食。羔羊之缝，素丝五总。委蛇委蛇，退食自公。","targetNotes":"现存页图可见全篇。","sourceLabel":"第 18-19 页","sourceNotes":"书页 18-19《羔羊》全篇韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"页图可读首章以“皮(biai)、紽(dai)、蛇(jiua)”叶歌部；第二章以“革(kak)、緎(hiuok)、食(djiak)”叶职部；第三章则以“缝(biong)、总(tzong)、公(kong)”叶东部。每章内部押韵整齐，而三章之间依次转部，显示《羔羊》在王力系统中是一篇章章换韵的作品。","notes":null}]}]}}}
